==Strategy==
Although this level might seem like quite a threat at first glance, simply using [[Ancient Egg: N205 (Special Cat)|Bride Cat]] in tandem Research Combos and strong attackers like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza]] makes it a piece of cake.

